WEBVTT

00:13.980 --> 00:16.471
Mom, I'd better get going now...

00:19.552 --> 00:21.520
My mom passed away...

00:21.588 --> 00:24.819
...and my grandpa will
be taking care of me.

00:27.394 --> 00:30.955
But ever since I was born,
I've never met my grandpa.

00:32.032 --> 00:34.762
The house I'm going
to is new to me, too...

00:43.043 --> 00:45.170
Taro Hanaukyo-sama, correct?

00:51.584 --> 00:53.609
I've come to pick you up...

00:53.686 --> 00:54.778
...Master.

01:06.299 --> 01:09.757
Hanaukyo Maid Team

01:10.336 --> 01:16.275
Open a window in the morning.

01:16.342 --> 01:22.872
Flowers of light
surround the world.

01:23.950 --> 01:29.855
As if the hidden
feeling in my heart...

01:29.923 --> 01:36.852
...is melting away now.

01:37.931 --> 01:43.096
I'm holding
the fragrance of the season.

01:43.970 --> 01:50.534
I pray to you...

01:50.610 --> 01:53.511
I wanted to meet you...

01:53.580 --> 01:57.243
...ever since the day I was born.

01:57.317 --> 02:00.218
Only you...

02:00.286 --> 02:04.723
...I want to protect only you.

02:04.791 --> 02:07.055
Just you...

02:07.127 --> 02:09.152
...I want to touch.

02:10.497 --> 02:15.434
My hand is going to hold you.

02:17.237 --> 02:19.171
I want to deliver.

02:20.573 --> 02:22.939
Voice of my heart.

02:25.278 --> 02:30.181
How Do You Do, Master

02:36.723 --> 02:39.021
This is your bag, isn't it?

02:46.432 --> 02:47.922
Wait a minute.

02:50.203 --> 02:51.261
Yes?

02:51.337 --> 02:53.202
U-Um...

02:53.273 --> 02:54.501
You are...

02:57.310 --> 02:58.800
I apologize.

02:58.878 --> 03:03.212
I am the head maid of
the Hanaukyo family, Mariel.

03:04.083 --> 03:05.050
Maid?

03:06.286 --> 03:08.220
So you're grandpa's maid?

03:09.289 --> 03:10.483
I see...

03:10.557 --> 03:13.185
Grandpa's pretty rich.

03:13.259 --> 03:14.226
No.

03:15.895 --> 03:18.261
I am your maid, Master.

03:23.169 --> 03:27.105
"I appoint Taro Hanaukyo
to be the head of the family.

03:27.173 --> 03:28.572
"Hokusai Hanaukyo..."

03:30.777 --> 03:31.869
U-Um...

03:34.247 --> 03:35.737
Oh, birds...

03:37.784 --> 03:39.376
It's serene, isn't it...

03:40.920 --> 03:42.285
That's not it...

03:42.355 --> 03:43.322
Yes?

03:43.389 --> 03:44.583
This letter...

03:45.458 --> 03:46.152
Yes.

03:46.226 --> 03:50.287
The other day, Hokusai
Hanaukyo-sama left that letter...

03:50.363 --> 03:52.695
...and departed the mansion.

03:52.765 --> 03:57.498
Therefore, you are the head of
the Hanaukyo family from today.

03:58.271 --> 03:59.203
The head...

03:59.272 --> 04:00.671
In other words, you're...

04:00.740 --> 04:03.174
Yes, you are my master.

04:03.243 --> 04:04.642
Wait a minute.

04:06.379 --> 04:08.438
That's too sudden...

04:09.415 --> 04:10.905
This is herb tea.

04:10.984 --> 04:12.349
I can't...

04:12.418 --> 04:14.010
You don't like it?

04:14.087 --> 04:15.452
Not that...

04:23.129 --> 04:25.154
Did it suit your tastes?

04:26.866 --> 04:29.130
Yeah, it's very delicious.

04:30.803 --> 04:32.498
Really?

04:32.572 --> 04:33.834
I am glad...

04:38.711 --> 04:40.645
Your ride seems to have arrived.

04:46.552 --> 04:49.646
Oh, Cynthia-chan, you came.

04:51.190 --> 04:53.886
Well, shall we go, Master?

04:57.997 --> 05:00.022
We'll arrive in about five minutes.

05:00.099 --> 05:01.066
All right.

05:08.408 --> 05:11.309
Yashima Sanae-san
of the security department.

05:11.377 --> 05:13.140
Security department...

05:17.917 --> 05:21.353
Um, how many
maids are there in total?

05:23.022 --> 05:24.489
Let's see...

05:24.557 --> 05:26.616
About that many.

05:37.737 --> 05:40.137
This is the Hanaukyo Maid Team.

05:41.207 --> 05:46.042
From your right, your aide staff,
wardrobe staff, personnel staff...

05:46.112 --> 05:48.979
...food staff, management staff,
secretarial staff.

05:49.048 --> 05:51.380
From the left,
medical staff, info staff...

05:51.451 --> 05:54.852
...security staff,
finance staff, technology staff.

05:54.921 --> 05:57.321
I've completed
transporting the master.

05:57.390 --> 05:58.357
Good work.

05:59.225 --> 06:00.283
Good timing.

06:01.294 --> 06:02.261
Master.

06:03.496 --> 06:07.796
She is the head of the security
department that will guard you.

06:07.867 --> 06:10.335
I am Konoe Tsurugi.

06:10.403 --> 06:11.961
H-How do you do?

06:13.039 --> 06:14.472
Well, excuse me.

06:18.811 --> 06:21.041
He seems different
than we imagined.

06:21.981 --> 06:24.074
Yashima, don't let
your guard down.

06:24.150 --> 06:25.549
Yes, ma'am!

06:25.618 --> 06:28.485
Konoe-shama,
how valiant you are...

06:38.398 --> 06:41.265
Am I going to live
in such a big room?

06:44.704 --> 06:46.797
I wonder where grandpa went.

06:47.607 --> 06:52.442
I just can't be the head
of such a big mansion...

07:00.653 --> 07:02.553
Please change your clothes.

07:02.622 --> 07:03.919
Change clothes?

07:05.324 --> 07:08.191
Yes, please leave it to us.

07:08.261 --> 07:09.751
Use this underwear.

07:11.564 --> 07:13.657
N-No, I can do it myself.

07:13.733 --> 07:17.567
Nonsense, you're going
to take away our jobs.

07:17.637 --> 07:19.127
Please put this on.

07:22.241 --> 07:24.072
We must be going.

07:29.248 --> 07:31.079
That was embarrassing...

07:31.150 --> 07:35.519
Well, let me give you
a tour of the mansion now.

07:37.089 --> 07:38.886
This is your office.

07:41.828 --> 07:45.389
Please primarily conduct
your business here.

07:46.466 --> 07:51.301
This is the great hall for parties
with over a thousand guests.

07:52.138 --> 07:53.230
Hey!

07:54.740 --> 07:57.004
This is the restroom.

07:57.076 --> 07:58.475
When you flush...

08:08.488 --> 08:12.549
That concludes
the tour of the mansion.

08:12.625 --> 08:14.286
Dinner is next...

08:16.362 --> 08:17.556
But...

08:17.630 --> 08:19.120
...there's no table.

08:19.832 --> 08:26.704
Today, the food department
will provide your meal personally.

08:29.675 --> 08:32.644
The appetizer is snapper
carpaccio topped with caviar.

08:32.712 --> 08:34.179
Wow...

08:34.247 --> 08:36.545
The soup is golden consommé.

08:36.616 --> 08:37.810
Great.

08:37.884 --> 08:40.114
The main dish is
whole roasted pig.

08:40.853 --> 08:44.448
- Followed by whole roasted cow.
- Whole roasted elephant.

08:44.524 --> 08:47.049
And whole roasted
unknown creature.

08:47.126 --> 08:49.151
Um, hey...

08:49.228 --> 08:50.661
Well, try some!

08:51.697 --> 08:55.463
Everyone, the master
cannot eat that much at once.

08:57.570 --> 08:59.538
Oh, you're right.

08:59.605 --> 09:02.438
Master, take a break
and have some water.

09:05.011 --> 09:07.002
Next is your bath.

09:07.079 --> 09:10.014
Your personal staff
will be in charge.

09:17.623 --> 09:19.887
How do you do?!

09:20.960 --> 09:22.951
H-Hey...

09:23.029 --> 09:25.862
Well, we will start washing!

09:25.932 --> 09:27.092
Here we go!

09:35.308 --> 09:37.139
H-Hey...

09:41.948 --> 09:44.416
Please have a good night's rest.

09:45.484 --> 09:46.781
Thank you.

09:46.852 --> 09:47.819
Good night.

09:50.690 --> 09:51.952
I'm tired...

10:01.701 --> 10:04.192
Oh, Master, how daring...

10:06.272 --> 10:08.365
Your personal staff, Lemon.

10:08.441 --> 10:09.931
- Marron.
- Melon.

10:10.009 --> 10:12.876
We came to warm up your bed!

10:12.945 --> 10:15.106
No, I'm not really cold...

10:15.181 --> 10:16.910
Then you must be hot.

10:16.983 --> 10:18.075
How sad...

10:18.150 --> 10:21.711
Then let's take off
these restrictive pajamas.

10:21.787 --> 10:22.879
H-Hey...

10:24.256 --> 10:26.121
I can't hold on anymore.

10:26.192 --> 10:28.092
Master...

10:28.160 --> 10:30.526
Please sleep on my breasts.

10:32.732 --> 10:35.292
No fair!
We promised to play fair!

10:35.368 --> 10:37.996
But I can't hold on.

10:38.070 --> 10:39.765
Master!

10:42.375 --> 10:45.572
You're terrible! Master's going
to sleep on my breasts!

10:48.814 --> 10:50.611
Master!

10:53.719 --> 10:56.153
Jeez, leave me alone!

11:03.329 --> 11:05.297
Master!

11:08.601 --> 11:13.129
Hanaukyo Maid Team

11:17.677 --> 11:19.304
A storeroom, maybe?

11:43.869 --> 11:45.166
Master! Master!

11:46.072 --> 11:47.403
Master!

11:50.443 --> 11:51.910
Thank goodness.

11:51.977 --> 11:53.911
You've regained consciousness.

12:02.254 --> 12:04.449
Oh, I'm sorry.

12:04.523 --> 12:09.085
This human body reconstruction
bed was the only one available.

12:09.161 --> 12:10.628
I'll release you now.

12:17.703 --> 12:19.432
Which switch was it?

12:19.505 --> 12:21.336
Not this one or this one...

12:36.055 --> 12:37.920
I'm sorry...

12:37.990 --> 12:39.389
I'm all right.

12:41.160 --> 12:43.754
By the way, this place...

12:43.829 --> 12:45.729
It's the basement laboratory.

12:45.798 --> 12:46.822
Laboratory?

12:46.899 --> 12:49.094
Oh, I apologize.

12:49.168 --> 12:53.730
I'm head of the Hanaukyo Maid
Team's tech staff, Ikuyo Suzuki.

12:54.907 --> 12:57.239
Please call me Ikuyossie.

12:59.211 --> 13:01.372
Why are you in a place like this?

13:03.082 --> 13:04.242
Well...

13:04.316 --> 13:06.284
To tell the truth...

13:06.352 --> 13:09.412
To tell the truth,
my parents abandoned me...

13:09.488 --> 13:11.649
...and this family took me in.

13:16.662 --> 13:19.130
I've been picked on
since I was a child...

13:19.198 --> 13:22.065
Now I'm assigned in name
only to the tech staff...

13:22.134 --> 13:23.931
...and stuck in the basement.

13:25.004 --> 13:26.767
T-That can't be...

13:28.073 --> 13:29.563
I lied!

13:31.177 --> 13:35.477
Don't you think basement air
somehow suits scientists better?

13:35.548 --> 13:36.674
That's why.

13:38.984 --> 13:42.784
By the way, do you have
any problems, Master?

13:43.989 --> 13:44.956
Me?

13:45.024 --> 13:47.356
Yes, please tell me.

13:47.426 --> 13:49.621
I'll help you as an apology.

13:53.566 --> 13:54.590
To tell the truth...

13:55.701 --> 14:00.070
I'm very thankful that the maids
are taking good care of me.

14:01.140 --> 14:04.735
But I want to be
alone sometimes.

14:06.846 --> 14:09.280
I have just the machine for you.

14:10.049 --> 14:11.778
Jealous-kun Alpha!

14:12.852 --> 14:16.811
With this, the girls won't
come near you anymore.

14:21.727 --> 14:24.287
I detect a heat source
near the master.

14:25.364 --> 14:28.162
I can't distinguish
or confirm the source.

14:31.770 --> 14:34.238
Everyone, take
emergency positions!

14:39.612 --> 14:42.410
I wonder if this is really all right?

14:43.549 --> 14:45.676
This will solve your problem.

14:47.653 --> 14:50.019
That chuckle disturbs me...

14:52.391 --> 14:55.019
Master, where are you?

14:55.094 --> 14:56.493
Master?

14:57.263 --> 14:58.230
Master!

15:00.532 --> 15:01.692
Thank goodness.

15:01.767 --> 15:03.894
I heard you were in danger...

15:14.113 --> 15:15.205
H-Hey...

15:20.986 --> 15:22.817
Stop!

15:22.888 --> 15:24.321
Master!

15:26.358 --> 15:28.792
No! Don't come near me!

15:31.230 --> 15:34.393
- What's going on?
- No!

15:35.301 --> 15:36.598
This is...

15:38.470 --> 15:39.664
That must be it.

15:39.738 --> 15:41.069
Leader!

15:42.007 --> 15:43.975
I will take care of this.

15:44.043 --> 15:45.635
But...

15:45.711 --> 15:48.077
Please leave it
to Yashima Sanae!

15:53.652 --> 15:56.587
- Master! Please wait!
- Master! Please wait!

15:56.655 --> 15:59.852
I'm all right, so don't follow me!

16:01.760 --> 16:03.284
Master!

16:03.362 --> 16:06.490
Jeez, we were worried
since you didn't come back.

16:08.100 --> 16:10.933
Now let's go back
to your room and sleep!

16:17.076 --> 16:19.601
No fair!
You had him all to yourself
earlier, didn't you?

16:20.279 --> 16:22.247
Now's not the time...

16:22.314 --> 16:23.281
Hold it!

16:24.450 --> 16:26.941
Master, please stay still.

16:28.153 --> 16:31.179
Now to show off my
abilities to Konoe-shama!

16:31.256 --> 16:32.518
Here I come!

16:52.611 --> 16:53.635
Master.

16:54.613 --> 16:57.104
Did you get hurt?

16:57.182 --> 16:58.774
No, I'm fine.

17:00.753 --> 17:03.278
You are the head of
the Hanaukyo family.

17:04.356 --> 17:06.722
I'd like you to be
aware of that fact.

17:06.792 --> 17:08.225
Konoe-san.

17:08.293 --> 17:12.024
We all serve
the Hanaukyo family.

17:12.097 --> 17:15.692
The head should be firm,
or he cannot lead us all.

17:16.769 --> 17:18.031
Sorry.

17:18.103 --> 17:20.503
I don't want you to apologize.

17:20.572 --> 17:21.834
I see...

17:21.907 --> 17:23.670
You're right.

17:23.742 --> 17:24.436
Sorry.

17:27.513 --> 17:29.811
How long are
you planning to hide?

17:29.882 --> 17:31.372
Yes?

17:31.450 --> 17:33.645
You started all this, didn't you?

17:33.719 --> 17:36.882
I'll punish you later,
so be prepared.

17:36.955 --> 17:37.853
All right?

17:37.923 --> 17:39.788
Oh, no!

17:41.894 --> 17:43.327
Wait, Konoe-san.

17:44.696 --> 17:48.291
Ikuyo-chan did this for me.

17:48.367 --> 17:51.700
So please don't punish her.

17:54.239 --> 17:56.173
I cannot do that.

17:57.242 --> 17:59.142
Then you should punish me, too.

18:00.312 --> 18:03.748
I don't know if I can
be the family head.

18:03.816 --> 18:05.943
I'm not prepared mentally.

18:07.086 --> 18:09.179
But I'll try my best...

18:11.423 --> 18:13.152
Isn't that good enough?

18:16.895 --> 18:18.157
Yashima, let's go.

18:19.531 --> 18:20.520
Right!

18:26.205 --> 18:28.002
Thank you, Konoe-san...

18:30.542 --> 18:33.272
I made everyone worry.

18:35.013 --> 18:36.139
I'm sorry.

18:36.949 --> 18:38.416
Master.

18:39.518 --> 18:41.486
The maids here...

18:41.553 --> 18:44.852
...have been waiting for
your arrival for a long time.

18:44.923 --> 18:47.255
We want to serve you.

18:47.326 --> 18:48.953
We want you to be happy.

18:49.027 --> 18:53.361
We've spent our time
thinking of you up until today.

18:54.600 --> 18:58.092
Would you please
understand our feelings?

19:01.874 --> 19:03.398
I understand.

19:03.475 --> 19:05.067
Take good care of me.

19:06.912 --> 19:08.038
But...

19:09.047 --> 19:11.242
I have only one favor to ask.

19:16.955 --> 19:18.115
I see.

19:19.191 --> 19:21.455
He has entered the mansion...

19:26.732 --> 19:28.791
Oh, I will serve the tea...

19:28.867 --> 19:30.164
No.

19:30.235 --> 19:31.964
I asked yesterday, right?

19:32.671 --> 19:35.231
I want to be in charge here.

19:36.008 --> 19:36.997
Yes...

19:37.075 --> 19:38.633
But...

19:38.710 --> 19:40.143
Here, Mariel-san.

19:47.186 --> 19:50.883
Um, please call me Mariel.

19:53.559 --> 19:54.753
Mariel...

19:56.762 --> 19:59.788
Then call me Taro, too.

19:59.865 --> 20:00.923
That...

20:00.999 --> 20:04.696
We want to be addressed
like that, so let's do so.

20:05.704 --> 20:07.296
All right, Mariel?

20:07.372 --> 20:08.669
Yes, Mas...

20:09.975 --> 20:13.274
No, Taro-sama,
if that's what you want...

20:16.815 --> 20:20.751
Then your breakfast will be
served at 8 o'clock today.

20:21.820 --> 20:24.653
I will come to get you later.

20:28.927 --> 20:30.189
Oh, Mariel.

20:31.997 --> 20:33.191
Yes?

20:33.265 --> 20:37.099
Yesterday, you said
the maids here...

20:37.169 --> 20:40.002
...have been
waiting for my arrival.

20:41.873 --> 20:43.704
You too, Mariel?

20:43.775 --> 20:45.367
Yes, of course.

20:46.511 --> 20:48.240
That herb tea, too.

20:48.313 --> 20:52.716
I had thought of you and
had it prepared for some time.

21:00.225 --> 21:02.318
Your face is red.

21:02.394 --> 21:04.055
Did you catch a cold?

21:04.129 --> 21:07.030
Oh, no! Go to bed immediately!

21:07.099 --> 21:09.260
W-When did you come in...

21:09.334 --> 21:11.427
It's the job of
your personal staff...

21:11.503 --> 21:15.371
...to always take
care of you, Taro-sama.

21:15.440 --> 21:16.532
Now hurry!

21:17.609 --> 21:21.511
I'm going to warm your bed up.

21:22.514 --> 21:25.608
Me too.

21:47.105 --> 21:50.370
Please leave everything to us.

21:50.442 --> 21:52.967
Hanaukyo Maid Team.

21:53.612 --> 21:56.775
We're going to take care of you.

21:56.848 --> 21:59.976
Your private personal team.

22:00.052 --> 22:03.146
Always to match your taste.

22:03.221 --> 22:05.951
We're highly motivated.

22:06.491 --> 22:09.654
We polish our minds and bodies.

22:09.728 --> 22:12.663
Tell us anything.

22:12.731 --> 22:24.268
Just want you to be
pleased, to be pleased.

22:25.444 --> 22:35.979
But, but,
what a cold-hearted man.

22:38.190 --> 22:44.356
Look, the stars are beautiful.

22:44.429 --> 22:49.992
Tomorrow sure
will be sunny, too.

22:51.069 --> 22:57.338
Tonight too, in your dream too...

22:57.409 --> 23:01.743
...we serve you.

23:11.189 --> 23:13.623
Mariel, what's today's schedule?

23:13.692 --> 23:15.683
Your marriage partner will visit.

23:15.761 --> 23:16.989
Oh, marriage...

23:17.062 --> 23:18.051
Marriage?

23:18.130 --> 23:20.291
Episode 2, A 10-Game Match?

23:20.365 --> 23:20.766
We'll serve you next
time as well, Master.

23:20.766 --> 23:23.068
Next Episode
A 10-Game Match?
We'll serve you next
time as well, Master.

23:23.068 --> 23:25.696
Next Episode
A 10-Game Match?
